I've pushed a new version that also allows non-virtual properties, e.g. for caching:

```php
#[SubscribedService]
public MyDependency $myCachedDependency {
    get => $this->myCachedDependency ??= $this->container->get(__METHOD__);
}
```

I'd personally probably leave caching the dependency up to the container, but I didn't feel like I should forbid using a backed property.
